<title>UK: BOE forecasts 650 mln stg shortage, offers no help.</title>
<headline>BOE forecasts 650 mln stg shortage, offers no help.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England did not offer the UK money market an early round of assistance after forecasting a liquidity shortage of around 650 million stg.</p>
</text>
